        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Technical review: Add docs for view-transition-name: match-element]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/39759</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/39759"/>
        <updated>2025-06-03T18:10:41.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>




<hr>
<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Chrome 137 supports the <code class="notranslate">view-transition-name</code> property's <code class="notranslate">match-element</code> value. See <a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5098745710247936" rel="nofollow">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5098745710247936</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">This PR:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Adds information on the new value to the <code class="notranslate">view-transition-name</code> reference page and rewrites the page to provide better structure.</li>
<li>Updates the relevant "Using..." guide to add appropriate mentions of the new property value, and improves the structure.</li>
